 notes={'CASE0001':'Viewed: most selected vehicle boxes overlap in the same visible vehicle vicinity; the IoU gain is not certified as a distinct-instance correction. Exact occluded identity remains uncertain.','CASE0002':'Viewed: frozen BBF favors a visible vehicle region while CE and geometric pooling select a disjoint elevated/background region. Arithmetic pooling preserves the visible vehicle choice here, but this case does not justify selecting pooling policies by sample.','CASE0007':'Viewed: CE/geometric pool move toward the partly off-image vehicle region, while frozen and arithmetic choices favor another visible vehicle region. The best A256 IoU is only about0.268, so this is also a candidate-coverage limitation; full out-of-view identity remains uncertain.','CASE0008':'Viewed: frozen BBF favors the large near foreground person; CE and both pools move to a distinct right-side region near a crouching/partly visible person. This erases a fusion correction. Association with the sentence reference is plausible but not independently certified.'};idx=rd(P)
 for r in idx:
  if r['case'] in notes:r['identity_review']=notes[r['case']]
 P.write_text(json.dumps(idx,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\n');summary={'generated_pages':len(idx),'pages_actually_viewed':len(notes),'viewed_aliases':list(notes),'not_identity_gold_annotation':True,'unviewed_remain_UNKNOWN':True,'observed_types':['overlapping candidate boxes with uncertain identity','visible vehicle versus elevated background selection','partly out-of-view target and low A256 oracle coverage','foreground person versus different person-region selection'],'no_case_specific_filter_rule_or_policy_selection':True};(H/'ATLAS_REVIEW_SUMMARY.json').write_text(json.dumps(summary,indent=2)+'\n')
 pair=rd(H/'RESIDUAL_PAIR_DIAGNOSTIC.json');p=H/'REPORT.md';p.write_text(p.read_text()+'\n## 实际看图与读出接口的竞争解释\n\n'+json.dumps(summary,indent=2)+'\n\n4/12页实际查看，其余保持UNKNOWN。正例既有明显不同可见区域的选择变化，也有相互重叠框的小幅定位差异，不能全部称为实例身份修复。负例包括目标车辆转到不相交背景区域，以及丢掉冻结融合已经救回的近处行人；这些不应再一概归为query重复。采用仍由总体结果决定，图页不筛评价分母。\n\n'+json.dumps(pair,indent=2)+'\n\n几何池将包含竞争残差的完整BBF概率与CE概率平均，确实使残差的有效系数减半。但在94条IoU恶化中，额外补回半份残差仅能反转8条当前新旧候选对的相对次序，86条该候选对仍不反转；另外3条正例候选对也可能被反转。这不是全候选重评分结果，但足以撤下“单纯恢复残差就能解释大部分退化”的优先级，不据此重启残差强度扫描。\n');print('REVIEW109_RECORDED',summary)
